  message: "Dogfood validated in PR #2353. Running 'hypergumbo io-boundaries --path .' on hypergumbo's own codebase produces: 199 boundary calls (55 fs_read, 94 fs_write, 6 net_send, 41 subprocess, 3 env_read). Results match expectations: heavy file I/O (source analysis), minimal network (dependency checking), subprocess use (git/tree-sitter). Fix for CLI dispatch also merged."  # 41b8
